# MVP Definition Summary

<!-- 中文注释：本文件说明 fl-mvp-definition 工作流的职责、边界、产物清单、确认状态和后续建议。 -->

## 1. Skill Responsibility

This workflow clarified and defined the MVP product scope through product-manager-style conversation.

Responsible for:

- Target users, core problem, product hypothesis, MVP scope, product surfaces, product acceptance, static preview.

Not responsible for:

- Technical architecture, database design, API design, implementation plan, deployment, or production code.

