## 4. Preview Constraints

- Covers all visual MVP pages and key states.
- Uses local mock data.
- Does not make network requests.
- Expresses product intent, not final implementation.
- Is oriented toward end users, with clear first-screen value, primary CTA, main path, and feedback states.

